From local/paseo-v0.9.1-companion Mon Sep 22 00:00:00 2001
From: zbai29 <zbai29@wisc.edu>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Launch bare 1M Claude models with the gateway suffix

Claude Code budgets a bare model id at 200k when ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL is not the
official API. Catalog ids whose window is already 1M, and whose [1m] form is
not a separate row, are sent with that suffix. The catalog id stays unchanged.

With the base URL unset or set to api.anthropic.com, the id sent to Claude
matches stock Paseo.

Applies to getpaseo/paseo v0.9.1 (818658520).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
